      <data key="d18">1. How does the SWG perform in the simulation of extreme cold events, and how does it compare to similar methods? Many rare event algorithms in climate science have been developed and applied to heatwaves, but very few have been applied to extreme cold events. Therefore, the first objective of this thesis is to adapt a</data>
