      <data key="d17">paragraph_based_00321</data>
      <data key="d18">ERA5 data are not stationary because of climate change between 1950 and 2020. This is illustrated for the temperature time series at different event durations in Fig. 1. This also appears in the z500 variations due to thermal expansion of the atmosphere. Thus we first checked that the non-stationarity does not affect t</data>
