      <data key="d17">paragraph_based_00441</data>
      <data key="d18">This chapter also presents a comparison study between the analogues-SWG and another rare event algorithm: the ensemble boosting of Gessner et al. (2021). The comparison shows that both methods perform similarly for the computation of extreme cold winters over Central Europe. The ensemble boosting simulated events are s</data>
