      <data key="d18">The North Atlantic winter jet is eddy driven and usually well separated from the subtropical jet. But the co-occurrence of thermal and eddy-driven jet mechanisms can result in a single merged jet. The configuration, latitude, speed and meandering of the jet stream are linked to different planetary wave activities and c</data>
