      <data key="d17">paragraph_based_00076</data>
      <data key="d18">Extreme cold events are projected to further decrease with global warming (Seneviratne et al. 2021; Committee on Extreme Weather Events and Climate Change Attribution et al. 2016). With increasing warming levels, as stated in the IPCC AR6: "the frequency and intensity of [. . . ] cold extremes will continue to decrease</data>
    </edge>
