      <data key="d17">paragraph_based_00196</data>
      <data key="d18">The control simulations encompass the range of observed average winter temperature (DJF), except for extremely rare values like those from the winter of 1963. The median of the importance-sampled simulations aligns closely with the coldest control simulation. Importantly, the SWG with importance sampling successfully s</data>
