      <data key="d17">paragraph_based_00215</data>
      <data key="d18">The question motivating the work presented in this chapter is to assess the plausibility of breaking cold records of the 20th century in the 21st century. This also stands as a case study of the use of the SWG for the study of extreme cold events, by investigating winter 1963 in Europe, and consolidates the method by c</data>
