      <data key="d15">69</data>
      <data key="d16">54</data>
      <data key="d17">paragraph_based_00354</data>
      <data key="d18">In late January 1963, a sudden stratospheric warming event took place with the associated weakened polar vortex and may have helped to maintain persistence in the anomalous conditions throughout February in Europe (Greatbatch et al., 2015).</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="winter 1963" target="phase negative de la NAO" id="verified_rel_003">
