      <data key="d18">Winter 1963 was associated with a negative North Atlantic Oscillation (NAO) index, indicating a lower-than-normal pressure difference between the Iceland low- and Azores high-pressure systems (Cattiaux et al., 2010; Greatbatch et al., 2015).</data>
    </edge>
